  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): マルバタバコ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9E%E3%83%AB%E3%83%90%E3%82%BF%E3%83%90%E3%82%B3",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 109566962,
      "text": "マルバタバコ は、タバコの品種の1つ。英語では Wild Tobacco、南米では mapacho などと呼ばれる。ナス科タバコ属の多年草の亜熱帯性植物である。原産地は南米である。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Nicotiana rustica",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nicotiana_rustica",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1370398498,
      "text": "Nicotiana rustica, commonly known as Aztec tobacco or strong tobacco, is a rainforest plant in the family Solanaceae native to South America. It is a very potent variety of tobacco, containing up to nine times more nicotine than common species of Nicotiana such as Nicotiana tabacum. More specifically, N. rustica leaves have a nicotine content as high as 9%, whereas N. tabacum leaves contain about 1 to 3%. The high concentration of nicotine in its leaves makes it useful for producing pesticides, and it has a wide variety of uses specific to cultures around the world. However, N. rustica is no longer cultivated in North America as N. tabacum has replaced it."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Nicotiana rustica",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nicotiana_rustica",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 171581431,
      "text": "Nicotiana rustica, también llamada mapacho o picietl, es una planta fanerógama perteneciente a la familia de las solanáceas y pariente cercana del tabaco."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Nicotiana rustica",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nicotiana_rustica",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 239602676,
      "text": "Le Petit Tabac ou Tabac de jardin (Nicotiana rustica) est une plante de la famille des Solanacées originaire de la cordillère des Andes et qui s'est répandu au Venezuela, en Amérique centrale, au Mexique et dans l'est des États-Unis. Il est plus rarement appelé Tabac rustique."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Nicotiana rustica",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nicotiana_rustica",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 73139809,
      "text": "Nicotiana rustica L., conhecida na América do Sul pelo nome comum de mapacho e no Vietname por thuoc lao, é uma planta da família das Solanaceae, cultivada pelo seu alto teor em alcaloides. É uma variedade potente do tabaco que devido sua grande concentração de nicotina é usada para produzir pesticidas orgânicos, já que as folhas de N. rustica têm um conteúdo ponderal de nicotina que pode atingir os 9%, enquanto as folhas de Nicotiana tabacum contêm apenas entre 1 e 3% daquele alcaloide."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Nicotiana rustica",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nicotiana_rustica",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29859313,
      "text": "Nicotiana rustica atau dikenal dengan Tembakau Aztek dan Tembakau Liar merupakan tumbuhan dari genus Nicotiana dan famili Solanaceae. N. rustica merupakan varietas tembakau yang masih ditanam di Amerika Selatan, Turki, Rusia, dan Vietnam karena sifatnya yang tahan terhadap kondisi iklim yang beragam. Konsentrasi nikotin pada N. rustica dinilai lebih tinggi dibandingkan Nicotiana tabacum dengan konsentrasi N. rustica sebesar 5-15% bobot daun kering, sedangkan N. Tabacum hanya 0.9% sampai 3.6% dari bobot daun kering. Kandungan nikotinnya yang tinggi membuatnya cocok digunakan sebagai pestisida, nikotin sulfat dan niasin."
    }
  },
